{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beats Of Fury is a mix of Rhythm games and bullet-hell shooters with a psychedelic atmosphere, start shooting the evil beats creating the best of music while getting your fingers smashed and your head twisted. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/fb24f8b55e61382e77858945cfd6a4a1.poster.avif?t=1767566778\" width=700 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/fb24f8b55e61382e77858945cfd6a4a1.webm?t=1767566778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727450/extras/fb24f8b55e61382e77858945cfd6a4a1.mp4?t=1767566778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story mode</strong>: currently including 12 handcrafted levels (more to be added) across 2 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Youtube Mode</strong> :\u00a0Add any link from youtube and play an autogenerated level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Mode</strong> :\u00a0 Add any track or videoclip from your PC and enjoy an autogenerated level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Library</strong> : Share your created levels with other players in the music library and play their created levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix it Mode</strong> : A mode in which the players will be able to play all the game music endlessly shuffling between them to compete with other players on leaderboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock world</strong>: includes Rock,Post-Rock and Metal music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electronic world</strong> : includes EDM, Trap, and House music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong>: to compete with other players on each of the 4 difficulties.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio visualization</strong> : this means that you will feel and experience every beat in the music at the deepest level possible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple ways to play</strong>:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For hardcore rhythm players</strong> : Play with aiming, Mouse and keyboard or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For casual rhythm players</strong> : Play with mouse only or keyboard only without aiming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color blind mode</strong> :  Choose from different settings for color-blind people.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For photosensitive people :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the game effects can be controlled or totally turned off while playing the game or from the options menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/b47c6ec5862aa3dbd098cfd4dd7bd764aae62d36.jpg"},{"name":"Medium Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/7374c904b3613ed091dcb340e7f0c6fd665ed01d.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/b561be182eb153965dca92a4e0c98fd3bc43a4d4.jpg"},{"name":"Extreme Win, you deserve it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/54ce087727aaf634ffad8e51889bfa4835af7bb3.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Musician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/b547df769eaff926bf864d15027e2dfd22837ed0.jpg"},{"name":"Good Musician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/5d643e8faac3fb2d7adece6e607fcb9f40688b3f.jpg"},{"name":"Great Musician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/727450/